[00:04.26] Shadows of shadows passing
[00:08.38] It is now 1831
[00:12.02] And as always
[00:13.70] I am absorbed with a delicate thought
[00:17.46] It is how poetry
[00:19.44] Has indefinite sensations
[00:21.94] To which end
[00:23.30] Music is inessential
[00:26.80] Since the comprehension of sweet sound
[00:29.88] Is our most indefinite conception
[00:32.92] Music
[00:34.98] When combined with a pleasurable idea
[00:38.58] Is poetry
[00:40.78] Music
[00:41.90] Without the idea
[00:44.32] Is simply music
[00:47.06] Without music
[00:48.96] Or an intriguing idea
[00:51.72] Color becomes pallor
[00:55.14] Man becomes carcass
[00:59.06] Home becomes catacomb
[01:03.88] And the dead
[01:05.66] Are but for a moment
[01:07.82] Motionless
